---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const emailHref = 'mailto:info@sitedokai.com?subject=Afklarende%20samtale%20om%20AI-adoption';
---

<footer class="mt-10 border-t border-line bg-brand text-paper">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-12 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_.75fr_.75fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-paper no-underline" aria-label="SiteDokAI, gå til forsiden">
        <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-paper text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M6.2 7.1c1.8-2 4-2.8 6.3-2.3 2.1.4 3.8 1.7 5.3 3.7M5 16c2 2.5 4.5 3.5 7.1 2.9 2.1-.5 3.8-1.8 5.2-4M7.8 12h8.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="font-display text-[1.35rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">SiteDok<span class="italic text-sage-soft">AI</span></span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-paper/70">
        Personlig hjælp til at gøre AI konkret, trygt og brugbart i arbejdet — med små piloter, tydeligt ansvar og læring, der kan skaleres.
      </p>
      <a href={emailHref} class="mt-6 inline-flex border-b border-paper/40 pb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-paper no-underline hover:border-paper">
        info@sitedokai.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Genveje">
      <h2 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper/65">Genveje</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/#ydelser" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Samarbejdet</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#metode" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Metoden</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#arbejdseksempel" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Arbejdseksempel</a></li>
        <li><a href="/om/" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Om mig</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav aria-label="Kontakt og vilkår">
      <h2 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper/65">Kontakt</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/kontakt/" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Kontakt</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/troels-%C3%B8stbjerg-37757726" rel="me noopener noreferrer" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy/" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Privatliv</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sitemap.xml" class="text-paper/70 no-underline hover:text-paper">Sitemap</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-paper/10">
    <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-2 py-5 text-xs leading-5 text-paper/50 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} SiteDokAI · Troels Østbjerg</p>
      <p>AI-rådgivning med menneskelig godkendelse og dokumenterede grænser.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
